{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09483","headline":"送褚校书归旧山歌 · 韦应物","name":"送褚校书归旧山歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握珠不返泉，匣玉不归山。\n明皇重士亦如此，忽怪褚生何得还。\n方称羽猎赋，未拜兰台职。\n汉箧亡书已暗传，嵩丘遗简还能识。\n朝朝待诏青鏁闱，中有万年之树蓬莱池。\n世人仰望栖此地，生独徘徊意何爲。\n故山可往薇可采，一自人间星岁改。\n藏书壁中苔半侵，洗药泉中月还在。\n春风饮饯灞陵原，莫厌归来朝市喧。\n不见东方朔，避世从容金马门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}